WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.570
Days later, you can still recall the
feeling of running, the sense of dread,

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.330
the moment you woke up.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.370
Most people never go beyond
level 2, but some do.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.760
Level 3, recurring nightmare,
the same nightmare, over and over

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.410
again, same hallway, same
monster, same moment of terror,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.330
night after night, sometimes
for weeks, or even years.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.440
Your brain doesn't randomly replay
the same dream for no reason when a

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:29.940
nightmare-

